# Hero UI Design Rules

## Components
Use Hero UI for all interactive UI:
- `Button`, `Card`, `Progress`, `Alert`, `Spinner`, `Tooltip`

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button className="bg-blue-500">Upload</button>

// ✅ GOOD
import { Button } from '@heroui/react';
<Button color="primary" variant="solid">Upload CSV</Button>
```

## Colors
- UI: Tailwind classes tied to Hero tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`)
- Chart: read CSS variables in `chartTheme.ts`, not hardcoded in chart options

## Candle colors
- Up: `--success`
- Down: `--danger`

## Layout
- Chart panel: `Card` with `className="bg-surface"`
- Page: `min-h-screen bg-background text-foreground`

See `docs/DESIGN.md` for full token table.
